{1000}{37C (All the pages are ripped out of this book, save the blank page at the end, upon which has been scrawled a note.)


Pheobe-

If ye be reading this, then I be dead. I always wanted to tell ye this, but Rath swore upon my life to tell no one. Since my life be gone now, I can now tell ye safely.  

Rath was buried outside his home, on the banks of the Dark River. 
No, you won't find the Dark River on any map, but I tell you, if you descend the well in the middle of town, all will be made clear.

}

{1010}{37c (This text discusses the History of the Kingdom of Gilead.)

}

{1020}{28l (Damp has rotted out all but the last few pages of this journal.) 

Fevruart 18, 5093

The hour draws near. I have foreseen my own death and although I cannot prevent it, I can prepare for it. I have invested all of power into ensuring that no one disturbs me after my death. My pets will defend me, and woe be to he who wears my amulet, indeed...


}